"DurationSeconds":7.584},{"SlideNumber":4,"Title":"L\u1EDBp ArrayList","NarrationText":"Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u ArrayList - c\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u danh s\u00E1ch \u0111\u1ED9ng, c\u00E1ch s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng v\u00E0 l\u1EE3i \u00EDch so v\u1EDBi m\u1EA3ng t\u0129nh.","AudioUrl":"/storage/audio/80097644-250d-4bef-99a2-90c57e161cee-slide-4.mp3","DurationSeconds":6.24},{"SlideNumber":5,"Title":"L\u1EDBp HashMap","NarrationText":"Tr\u00ECnh b\u00E0y v\u1EC1 HashMap, c\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u theo c\u1EB7p kh\u00F3a-gi\u00E1 tr\u1ECB v\u00E0 l\u1EE3i \u00EDch trong truy c\u1EADp d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u nhanh ch\u00F3ng.","AudioUrl":"/storage/audio/80097644-250d-4bef-99a2-90c57e161cee-slide-5.mp3","DurationSeconds":6.648},{"SlideNumber":6,"Title":"T\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt v\u00E0 \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng","NarrationText":"T\u00F3m t\u1EAFt l\u1EA1i c\u00E1c l\u1EDBp c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n \u0111\u00E3 h\u1ECDc v\u00E0 nh\u1EA5n m\u1EA1nh t\u1EA7m quan tr\u1ECDng c\u1EE7a ch\u00FAng trong vi\u1EC7c x\u00E2y d\u1EF1ng \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng Java hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3.","AudioUrl":"/storage/audio/80097644-250d-4bef-99a2-90c57e161cee-slide-6.mp3","DurationSeconds":6.576}]', N'Completed', NULL, '2026-06-12T13:35:57.002448', N'Completed', NULL, '2026-06-12T13:36:07.113836', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1);
