INSERT INTO [dbo].[Lessons] ([Id], [ModuleId], [Title], [Description], [OrderIndex], [ContentSeed], [VideoUrl], [AudioUrl], [Duration], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [TeachingScript], [SlideOutlineJson], [VoiceoverPlanJson], [ContentGenerationStatus], [ContentGeneratedAt], [ContentGenerationError], [AudioSegmentsJson], [AudioGenerationStatus], [AudioGenerationError], [AudioGeneratedAt], [VideoGenerationStatus], [VideoGenerationError], [VideoGeneratedAt], [PresenterOverlayVideoPath], [PresenterOverlayStatus], [PresenterOverlayGeneratedAt], [PresenterOverlaySourceHash], [NarrationVoiceKey], [TranscriptText], [VoiceTutorEnabled]) VALUES ('78e31d02-374f-4be3-8876-98bd5efce96a', '35efa6cd-f86b-4ec0-8a31-da893ac115c8', N'Tính kế thừa - Inheritance', N'Khái niệm và ứng dụng kế thừa trong Java.', 1, N'Tính kế thừa - Inheritance', N'/storage/video/78e31d02-374f-4be3-8876-98bd5efce96a.mp4', N'/storage/audio/78e31d02-374f-4be3-8876-98bd5efce96a.mp3', 41, '2026-06-12T13:11:29.007843', '2026-06-12T13:36:57.193290', N'Chào mừng các bạn đến với bài học về tính kế thừa trong lập trình hướng đối tượng bằng Java. Trong bài học này, chúng ta sẽ tìm hiểu khái niệm kế thừa, cách sử dụng kế thừa để tái sử dụng mã nguồn, cũng như những lợi ích và ứng dụng thực tế của nó. Kế thừa cho phép một lớp con thừa hưởng các thuộc tính và phương thức từ lớp cha, giúp giảm thiểu sự trùng lặp và tăng tính mở rộng cho chương trình. Hãy cùng khám phá chi tiết qua các phần tiếp theo.', N'[{"SlideNumber":1,"Title":"Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u v\u1EC1 k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, a tree with branches extending upwards symbolizing growth and inheritance, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Kh\u00E1i ni\u1EC7m k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa trong OOP","L\u1EDBp cha v\u00E0 l\u1EDBp con","T\u00E1i s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng m\u00E3 ngu\u1ED3n"],"SpeakerNotes":"Slide n\u00E0y gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u t\u1ED5ng quan v\u1EC1 k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa trong l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng. H\u00ECnh \u1EA3nh c\u00E2y v\u1EDBi c\u00E1c nh\u00E1nh t\u01B0\u1EE3ng tr\u01B0ng cho s\u1EF1 m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng v\u00E0 th\u1EEBa k\u1EBF c\u00E1c \u0111\u1EB7c t\u00EDnh t\u1EEB l\u1EDBp cha sang l\u1EDBp con."},{"SlideNumber":2,"Title":"C\u00E1ch khai b\u00E1o k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa trong Java","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, two interlocking puzzle pieces representing connection and extension, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["T\u1EEB kh\u00F3a extends","L\u1EDBp con k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh v\u00E0 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c","V\u00ED d\u1EE5 \u0111\u01A1n gi\u1EA3n"],"SpeakerNotes":"Tr\u00ECnh b\u00E0y c\u00E1ch s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng t\u1EEB kh\u00F3a extends trong Java \u0111\u1EC3 khai b\u00E1o m\u1ED9t l\u1EDBp con k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa t\u1EEB l\u1EDBp cha. H\u00ECnh \u1EA3nh hai m\u1EA3nh gh\u00E9p th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n s\u1EF1 k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i v\u00E0 m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng gi\u1EEFa c\u00E1c l\u1EDBp."},{"SlideNumber":3,"Title":"L\u1EE3i \u00EDch c\u1EE7a k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, a growing bar chart made of ascending blocks symbolizing improvement and efficiency, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["T\u00E1i s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng m\u00E3 ngu\u1ED3n","D\u1EC5 b\u1EA3o tr\u00EC v\u00E0 m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng","Gi\u1EA3m thi\u1EC3u l\u1ED7i l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh"],"SpeakerNotes":"N\u00EAu r\u00F5 c\u00E1c l\u1EE3i \u00EDch khi s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa trong ph\u00E1t tri\u1EC3n ph\u1EA7n m\u1EC1m nh\u01B0 t\u00E1i s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng m\u00E3, d\u1EC5 d\u00E0ng b\u1EA3o tr\u00EC v\u00E0 m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\u00ECnh, \u0111\u1ED3ng th\u1EDDi gi\u1EA3m thi\u1EC3u l\u1ED7i do tr\u00F9ng l\u1EB7p m\u00E3."},{"SlideNumber":4,"Title":"\u1EE8ng d\u1EE5ng th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF c\u1EE7a k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, a network of connected gears working together symbolizing collaboration and hierarchy, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng ph\u00E2n c\u1EA5p l\u1EDBp","T\u1EA1o c\u00E1c l\u1EDBp con chuy\u00EAn bi\u1EC7t","T\u1ED1i \u01B0u h\u00F3a c\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\u00ECnh"],"SpeakerNotes":"Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u c\u00E1c \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF c\u1EE7a k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa trong thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF ph\u1EA7n m\u1EC1m, nh\u01B0 x\u00E2y d\u1EF1ng h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng ph\u00E2n c\u1EA5p l\u1EDBp, t\u1EA1o c\u00E1c l\u1EDBp con v\u1EDBi ch\u1EE9c n\u0103ng chuy\u00EAn bi\u1EC7t, gi\u00FAp t\u1ED1i \u01B0u h\u00F3a c\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\u00ECnh."}]', N'{"EstimatedDurationMinutes":10,"Tone":"Th\u00E2n thi\u1EC7n, r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng, truy\u1EC1n c\u1EA3m","Pacing":"Ch\u1EADm v\u1EEBa ph\u1EA3i, d\u1EC5 theo d\u00F5i","TargetAudience":"Sinh vi\u00EAn \u0111\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc ng\u00E0nh c\u00F4ng ngh\u1EC7 th\u00F4ng tin, l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh vi\u00EAn m\u1EDBi b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u h\u1ECDc Java","PronunciationNotes":"Ph\u00E1t \u00E2m r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng c\u00E1c thu\u1EADt ng\u1EEF chuy\u00EAn ng\u00E0nh nh\u01B0 \u0027k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa\u0027, \u0027l\u1EDBp cha\u0027, \u0027l\u1EDBp con\u0027, \u0027extends\u0027, tr\u00E1nh n\u00F3i nhanh \u0111\u1EC3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1ECDc d\u1EC5 ti\u1EBFp thu"}', N'Completed', '2026-06-12T13:36:17.389457', NULL, N'[{"SlideNumber":1,"Title":"Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u v\u1EC1 k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa","NarrationText":"Slide n\u00E0y gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u t\u1ED5ng quan v\u1EC1 k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa trong l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng. H\u00ECnh \u1EA3nh c\u00E2y v\u1EDBi c\u00E1c nh\u00E1nh t\u01B0\u1EE3ng tr\u01B0ng cho s\u1EF1 m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng v\u00E0 th\u1EEBa k\u1EBF c\u00E1c \u0111\u1EB7c t\u00EDnh t\u1EEB l\u1EDBp cha sang l\u1EDBp con.","AudioUrl":"/storage/audio/78e31d02-374f-4be3-8876-98bd5efce96a-slide-1.mp3","DurationSeconds":10.464},{"SlideNumber":2,"Title":"C\u00E1ch khai b\u00E1o k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa trong Java","NarrationText":"Tr\u00ECnh b\u00E0y c\u00E1ch s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng t\u1EEB kh\u00F3a extends trong Java \u0111\u1EC3 khai b\u00E1o m\u1ED9t l\u1EDBp con k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa t\u1EEB l\u1EDBp cha. H\u00ECnh \u1EA3nh hai m\u1EA3nh gh\u00E9p th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n s\u1EF1 k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i v\u00E0 m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng gi\u1EEFa c\u00E1c l\u1EDBp.","AudioUrl":"/storage/audio/78e31d02-374f-4be3-8876-98bd5efce96a-slide-2.mp3","DurationSeconds":10.464},{"SlideNumber":3,"Title":"L\u1EE3i \u00EDch c\u1EE7a k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa","NarrationText":"N\u00EAu r\u00F5 c\u00E1c l\u1EE3i \u00EDch khi s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa trong ph\u00E1t tri\u1EC3n ph\u1EA7n m\u1EC1m nh\u01B0 t\u00E1i s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng m\u00E3, d\u1EC5 d\u00E0ng b\u1EA3o tr\u00EC v\u00E0 m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\u00ECnh, \u0111\u1ED3ng th\u1EDDi gi\u1EA3m thi\u1EC3u l\u1ED7i do tr\u00F9ng l\u1EB7p m\u00E3.","AudioUrl":"/storage/audio/78e31d02-374f-4be3-8876-98bd5efce96a-slide-3.mp3","DurationSeconds":9.384},{"SlideNumber":4,"Title":"\u1EE8ng d\u1EE5ng th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF c\u1EE7a k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa","NarrationText":"Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u c\u00E1c \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF c\u1EE7a k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa trong thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF ph\u1EA7n m\u1EC1m, nh\u01B0 x\u00E2y d\u1EF1ng h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng ph\u00E2n c\u1EA5p l\u1EDBp, t\u1EA1o c\u00E1c l\u1EDBp con v\u1EDBi ch\u1EE9c n\u0103ng chuy\u00EAn bi\u1EC7t, gi\u00FAp t\u1ED1i \u01B0u h\u00F3a c\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\u00ECnh.","AudioUrl":"/storage/audio/78e31d02-374f-4be3-8876-98bd5efce96a-slide-4.mp3","DurationSeconds":10.08}]', N'Completed', NULL, '2026-06-12T13:36:51.610719', N'Completed', NULL, '2026-06-12T13:36:57.193290', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Lessons] ([Id], [ModuleId], [Title], [Description], [OrderIndex], [ContentSeed], [VideoUrl], [AudioUrl], [Duration], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [TeachingScript], [SlideOutlineJson], [VoiceoverPlanJson], [ContentGenerationStatus], [ContentGeneratedAt], [ContentGenerationError], [AudioSegmentsJson], [AudioGenerationStatus], [AudioGenerationError], [AudioGeneratedAt], [VideoGenerationStatus], [VideoGenerationError], [VideoGeneratedAt], [PresenterOverlayVideoPath], [PresenterOverlayStatus], [PresenterOverlayGeneratedAt], [PresenterOverlaySourceHash], [NarrationVoiceKey], [TranscriptText], [VoiceTutorEnabled]) VALUES ('647902dd-4d61-4f61-9c0d-992d777f9719', '65ba1924-811c-4c42-b2e6-65a8f907b66d', N'Định nghĩa lớp Generic', N'Cách định nghĩa và sử dụng lớp Generic trong Java.', 2, N'Định nghĩa lớp Generic', N'/storage/video/647902dd-4d61-4f61-9c0d-992d777f9719.mp4', N'/storage/audio/647902dd-4d61-4f61-9c0d-992d777f9719.mp3', 35, '2026-06-12T13:11:29.007859', '2026-06-12T13:57:16.843141', N'Chào mừng các bạn đến với bài học hôm nay về định nghĩa lớp Generic trong Java. Trong lập trình hướng đối tượng, Generic giúp chúng ta tạo ra các lớp và phương thức có thể làm việc với nhiều kiểu dữ liệu khác nhau mà không cần phải viết lại mã cho từng kiểu cụ thể. Điều này giúp tăng tính tái sử dụng và an toàn kiểu dữ liệu trong chương trình. 
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Lessons] ([Id], [ModuleId], [Title], [Description], [OrderIndex], [ContentSeed], [VideoUrl], [AudioUrl], [Duration], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [TeachingScript], [SlideOutlineJson], [VoiceoverPlanJson], [ContentGenerationStatus], [ContentGeneratedAt], [ContentGenerationError], [AudioSegmentsJson], [AudioGenerationStatus], [AudioGenerationError], [AudioGeneratedAt], [VideoGenerationStatus], [VideoGenerationError], [VideoGeneratedAt], [PresenterOverlayVideoPath], [PresenterOverlayStatus], [PresenterOverlayGeneratedAt], [PresenterOverlaySourceHash], [NarrationVoiceKey], [TranscriptText], [VoiceTutorEnabled]) VALUES ('9ed608b9-ff46-4a0c-9f99-9c10333f0de6', '30592ce3-9399-4a06-abb8-f82cd98b0a43', N'Phương thức và thuộc tính', N'Các loại phương thức, thuộc tính và kỹ thuật overloading.', 2, N'Phương thức và thuộc tính', N'/storage/video/9ed608b9-ff46-4a0c-9f99-9c10333f0de6.mp4', N'/storage/audio/9ed608b9-ff46-4a0c-9f99-9c10333f0de6.mp3', 74, '2026-06-12T13:11:29.007841', '2026-06-12T13:32:50.018400', N'Chào mừng các bạn đến với bài học hôm nay về phương thức và thuộc tính trong lập trình hướng đối tượng với Java. Trong bài học này, chúng ta sẽ tìm hiểu các loại phương thức, thuộc tính và kỹ thuật overloading - một kỹ thuật quan trọng giúp tăng tính linh hoạt cho chương trình. Đầu tiên, chúng ta sẽ khám phá khái niệm phương thức và thuộc tính, cách khai báo và sử dụng chúng trong lớp. Tiếp theo, chúng ta sẽ phân biệt các loại phương thức như phương thức khởi tạo, phương thức tĩnh và phương thức đối tượng. Cuối cùng, chúng ta sẽ tìm hiểu kỹ thuật overloading - cách định nghĩa nhiều phương thức cùng tên nhưng khác tham số để mở rộng chức năng. Qua bài học này, các bạn sẽ nắm vững cách thiết kế lớp hiệu quả và áp dụng linh hoạt các phương thức, thuộc tính trong Java. Bây giờ, chúng ta bắt đầu nhé!', N'[{"SlideNumber":1,"Title":"Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u v\u1EC1 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c v\u00E0 thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract shapes representing connection and structure, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c: h\u00E0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","Thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh: \u0111\u1EB7c \u0111i\u1EC3m c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","C\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n trong l\u1EDBp Java"],"SpeakerNotes":"Slide n\u00E0y gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u kh\u00E1i ni\u1EC7m c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n v\u1EC1 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c v\u00E0 thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh trong l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng. Ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c l\u00E0 c\u00E1c h\u00E0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng m\u00E0 \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n, c\u00F2n thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh l\u00E0 c\u00E1c \u0111\u1EB7c \u0111i\u1EC3m, d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng. C\u1EA3 hai l\u00E0 th\u00E0nh ph\u1EA7n quan tr\u1ECDng c\u1EA5u th\u00E0nh l\u1EDBp trong Java."},{"SlideNumber":2,"Title":"C\u00E1c lo\u1EA1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c trong Java","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract gears interlocking symbolizing different method types, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c kh\u1EDFi t\u1EA1o (Constructor)","Ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng (Instance method)","Ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c t\u0129nh (Static method)"],"SpeakerNotes":"\u1EDE slide n\u00E0y, ta ph\u00E2n bi\u1EC7t ba lo\u1EA1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c ch\u00EDnh trong Java. Ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c kh\u1EDFi t\u1EA1o d\u00F9ng \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng, ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng tr\u00EAn t\u1EEBng th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n ri\u00EAng bi\u1EC7t, c\u00F2n ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c t\u0129nh thu\u1ED9c v\u1EC1 l\u1EDBp v\u00E0 c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 g\u1ECDi m\u00E0 kh\u00F4ng c\u1EA7n t\u1EA1o \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng."},{"SlideNumber":3,"Title":"Thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh trong l\u1EDBp Java","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract blocks stacked representing data fields, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Bi\u1EBFn th\u00E0nh vi\u00EAn l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u","C\u00F3 th\u1EC3 l\u00E0 t\u0129nh ho\u1EB7c kh\u00F4ng t\u0129nh","Quy t\u1EAFc truy c\u1EADp v\u00E0 ph\u1EA1m vi"],"SpeakerNotes":"Thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh l\u00E0 c\u00E1c bi\u1EBFn th\u00E0nh vi\u00EAn trong l\u1EDBp d\u00F9ng \u0111\u1EC3 l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u \u0111\u1EB7c tr\u01B0ng cho \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng. Thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 l\u00E0 t\u0129nh (chung cho l\u1EDBp) ho\u1EB7c kh\u00F4ng t\u0129nh (ri\u00EAng cho t\u1EEBng \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng). Vi\u1EC7c khai b\u00E1o v\u00E0 truy c\u1EADp thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh c\u1EA7n tu\u00E2n theo quy t\u1EAFc ph\u1EA1m vi v\u00E0 truy c\u1EADp trong Java."},{"SlideNumber":4,"Title":"K\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt Overloading","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract overlapping shapes symbolizing multiple options, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["\u0110\u1ECBnh ngh\u0129a nhi\u1EC1u ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c c\u00F9ng t\u00EAn","Kh\u00E1c nhau v\u1EC1 tham s\u1ED1","T\u0103ng t\u00EDnh linh ho\u1EA1t v\u00E0 d\u1EC5 \u0111\u1ECDc m\u00E3"],"SpeakerNotes":"Overloading l\u00E0 k\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt \u0111\u1ECBnh ngh\u0129a nhi\u1EC1u ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c c\u00F9ng t\u00EAn trong m\u1ED9t l\u1EDBp nh\u01B0ng kh\u00E1c nhau v\u1EC1 ki\u1EC3u ho\u1EB7c s\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng tham s\u1ED1. \u0110i\u1EC1u n\u00E0y gi\u00FAp t\u0103ng t\u00EDnh linh ho\u1EA1t khi g\u1ECDi ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c v\u00E0 l\u00E0m cho m\u00E3 ngu\u1ED3n d\u1EC5 hi\u1EC3u h\u01A1n."},{"SlideNumber":5,"Title":"T\u00F3m t\u1EAFt v\u00E0 \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract network nodes connecting to a central point, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c v\u00E0 thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh l\u00E0 n\u1EC1n t\u1EA3ng OOP","Overloading gi\u00FAp m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng ch\u1EE9c n\u0103ng","\u00C1p d\u1EE5ng trong thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF l\u1EDBp hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3"],"SpeakerNotes":"T\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt l\u1EA1i, ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c v\u00E0 thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh l\u00E0 n\u1EC1n t\u1EA3ng c\u1EE7a l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng. K\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt overloading gi\u00FAp m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng ch\u1EE9c n\u0103ng ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c m\u1ED9t c\u00E1ch linh ho\u1EA1t. Hi\u1EC3u v\u00E0 v\u1EADn d\u1EE5ng t\u1ED1t c\u00E1c kh\u00E1i ni\u1EC7m n\u00E0y s\u1EBD gi\u00FAp b\u1EA1n thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF l\u1EDBp v\u00E0 \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng Java hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3 h\u01A1n."}]', N'{"EstimatedDurationMinutes":12,"Tone":"Th\u00E2n thi\u1EC7n, r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng, chuy\u00EAn nghi\u1EC7p","Pacing":"Ch\u1EADm v\u1EEBa ph\u1EA3i, nh\u1EA5n m\u1EA1nh c\u00E1c thu\u1EADt ng\u1EEF quan tr\u1ECDng","TargetAudience":"Sinh vi\u00EAn \u0111\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc ng\u00E0nh c\u00F4ng ngh\u1EC7 th\u00F4ng tin, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EDBi h\u1ECDc l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","PronunciationNotes":"Ph\u00E1t \u00E2m r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng c\u00E1c thu\u1EADt ng\u1EEF ti\u1EBFng Anh nh\u01B0 \u0027method\u0027, \u0027attribute\u0027, \u0027overloading\u0027, \u0027constructor\u0027 theo chu\u1EA9n ti\u1EBFng Vi\u1EC7t, tr\u00E1nh nu\u1ED1t \u00E2m"}', N'Completed', '2026-06-12T13:31:38.415141', NULL, N'[{"SlideNumber":1,"Title":"Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u v\u1EC1 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c v\u00E0 thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh","NarrationText":"Slide n\u00E0y gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u kh\u00E1i ni\u1EC7m c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n v\u1EC1 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c v\u00E0 thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh trong l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh h\