INSERT INTO [dbo].[Lessons] ([Id], [ModuleId], [Title], [Description], [OrderIndex], [ContentSeed], [VideoUrl], [AudioUrl], [Duration], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [TeachingScript], [SlideOutlineJson], [VoiceoverPlanJson], [ContentGenerationStatus], [ContentGeneratedAt], [ContentGenerationError], [AudioSegmentsJson], [AudioGenerationStatus], [AudioGenerationError], [AudioGeneratedAt], [VideoGenerationStatus], [VideoGenerationError], [VideoGeneratedAt], [PresenterOverlayVideoPath], [PresenterOverlayStatus], [PresenterOverlayGeneratedAt], [PresenterOverlaySourceHash], [NarrationVoiceKey], [TranscriptText], [VoiceTutorEnabled]) VALUES ('3f46e5d4-4f63-4f81-94b8-af7478b22ef9', '30592ce3-9399-4a06-abb8-f82cd98b0a43', N'Xây dựng đối tượng', N'Tạo và sử dụng đối tượng trong Java.', 4, N'Xây dựng đối tượng', N'/storage/video/3f46e5d4-4f63-4f81-94b8-af7478b22ef9.mp4', N'/storage/audio/3f46e5d4-4f63-4f81-94b8-af7478b22ef9.mp3', 44, '2026-06-12T13:11:29.007842', '2026-06-12T13:34:46.382174', N'Chào mừng các bạn đến với bài học hôm nay về xây dựng đối tượng trong Java. Trong lập trình hướng đối tượng, đối tượng là thực thể đại diện cho một thực thể trong thế giới thực hoặc khái niệm trừu tượng. Để xây dựng đối tượng, trước hết chúng ta cần hiểu lớp là khuôn mẫu để tạo ra các đối tượng. Một đối tượng được tạo ra từ lớp sẽ có các thuộc tính và phương thức riêng. Trong bài học này, chúng ta sẽ tìm hiểu cách khai báo đối tượng, khởi tạo và sử dụng đối tượng trong Java. Ngoài ra, chúng ta cũng sẽ xem xét cách truy cập các thành phần của đối tượng và tương tác giữa các đối tượng với nhau. Qua đó, các bạn sẽ nắm vững kỹ năng xây dựng và sử dụng đối tượng hiệu quả trong các ứng dụng thực tế.', N'[{"SlideNumber":1,"Title":"Kh\u00E1i ni\u1EC7m \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng trong Java","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, a glowing sphere representing a single entity surrounded by abstract digital connections, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["\u0110\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng l\u00E0 th\u1EF1c th\u1EC3 trong l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1o ra t\u1EEB l\u1EDBp (class)","Ch\u1EE9a thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh v\u00E0 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c ri\u00EAng"],"SpeakerNotes":"Slide n\u00E0y gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u kh\u00E1i ni\u1EC7m c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n v\u1EC1 \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng trong Java. \u0110\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng l\u00E0 m\u1ED9t th\u1EF1c th\u1EC3 c\u1EE5 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1o ra t\u1EEB l\u1EDBp, c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 ch\u1EE9a d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u v\u00E0 c\u00E1c h\u00E0nh vi th\u00F4ng qua thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh v\u00E0 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c."},{"SlideNumber":2,"Title":"T\u1EA1o \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng trong Java","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract hands assembling glowing puzzle pieces symbolizing object creation, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Khai b\u00E1o bi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","S\u1EED d\u1EE5ng t\u1EEB kh\u00F3a new \u0111\u1EC3 kh\u1EDFi t\u1EA1o","G\u00E1n \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng cho bi\u1EBFn"],"SpeakerNotes":"\u1EDE slide n\u00E0y, ch\u00FAng ta t\u00ECm hi\u1EC3u c\u00E1ch t\u1EA1o \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng trong Java. \u0110\u1EA7u ti\u00EAn khai b\u00E1o bi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng, sau \u0111\u00F3 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng t\u1EEB kh\u00F3a new \u0111\u1EC3 g\u1ECDi h\u00E0m kh\u1EDFi t\u1EA1o v\u00E0 g\u00E1n \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\u1EEBa t\u1EA1o cho bi\u1EBFn \u0111\u00F3."},{"SlideNumber":3,"Title":"Truy c\u1EADp th\u00E0nh ph\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract glowing nodes connected by lines representing access to object properties, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["S\u1EED d\u1EE5ng d\u1EA5u ch\u1EA5m (.) \u0111\u1EC3 truy c\u1EADp","G\u1ECDi thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh v\u00E0 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","V\u00ED d\u1EE5: object.method()"],"SpeakerNotes":"Slide n\u00E0y tr\u00ECnh b\u00E0y c\u00E1ch truy c\u1EADp c\u00E1c th\u00E0nh ph\u1EA7n b\u00EAn trong \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng. D\u1EA5u ch\u1EA5m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\u00F9ng \u0111\u1EC3 g\u1ECDi thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh ho\u1EB7c ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng, gi\u00FAp t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u00E1c v\u00E0 thao t\u00E1c v\u1EDBi d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u b\u00EAn trong."},{"SlideNumber":4,"Title":"V\u00ED d\u1EE5 minh h\u1ECDa x\u00E2y d\u1EF1ng \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract glowing blocks assembling into a structured form symbolizing object instantiation, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Khai b\u00E1o l\u1EDBp v\u00E0 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c kh\u1EDFi t\u1EA1o","T\u1EA1o \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng t\u1EEB l\u1EDBp","G\u1ECDi ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c v\u00E0 truy c\u1EADp thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh"],"SpeakerNotes":"\u1EDE slide cu\u1ED1i, ch\u00FAng ta s\u1EBD xem v\u00ED d\u1EE5 minh h\u1ECDa c\u1EE5 th\u1EC3 v\u1EC1 c\u00E1ch x\u00E2y d\u1EF1ng \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng trong Java, t\u1EEB khai b\u00E1o l\u1EDBp, t\u1EA1o \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u0111\u1EBFn s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng c\u00E1c ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c v\u00E0 thu\u1ED9c t\u00EDnh c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u0111\u00F3."}]', N'{"EstimatedDurationMinutes":10,"Tone":"Truy\u1EC1n c\u1EA3m, th\u00E2n thi\u1EC7n, r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng","Pacing":"Ch\u1EADm v\u1EEBa ph\u1EA3i, d\u1EC5 theo d\u00F5i","TargetAudience":"Sinh vi\u00EAn \u0111\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc ng\u00E0nh c\u00F4ng ngh\u1EC7 th\u00F4ng tin, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EDBi h\u1ECDc l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","PronunciationNotes":"Ph\u00E1t \u00E2m r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng c\u00E1c thu\u1EADt ng\u1EEF chuy\u00EAn ng\u00E0nh nh\u01B0