INSERT INTO [dbo].[Lessons] ([Id], [ModuleId], [Title], [Description], [OrderIndex], [ContentSeed], [VideoUrl], [AudioUrl], [Duration], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [TeachingScript], [SlideOutlineJson], [VoiceoverPlanJson], [ContentGenerationStatus], [ContentGeneratedAt], [ContentGenerationError], [AudioSegmentsJson], [AudioGenerationStatus], [AudioGenerationError], [AudioGeneratedAt], [VideoGenerationStatus], [VideoGenerationError], [VideoGeneratedAt], [PresenterOverlayVideoPath], [PresenterOverlayStatus], [PresenterOverlayGeneratedAt], [PresenterOverlaySourceHash], [NarrationVoiceKey], [TranscriptText], [VoiceTutorEnabled]) VALUES ('a902cd25-00b8-437c-92f5-b297a235f61e', '440378dd-42a8-420d-a977-d6c957353bc3', N'Kiểu dữ liệu trừu tượng', N'Khái niệm kiểu dữ liệu trừu tượng trong OOP.', 1, N'Kiểu dữ liệu trừu tượng', N'/storage/video/a902cd25-00b8-437c-92f5-b297a235f61e.mp4', N'/storage/audio/a902cd25-00b8-437c-92f5-b297a235f61e.mp3', 74, '2026-06-12T13:11:29.007830', '2026-06-12T13:18:15.464626', N'Chào mừng các bạn đến với bài học về Kiểu dữ liệu trừu tượng trong lập trình hướng đối tượng. Trong bài học này, chúng ta sẽ tìm hiểu khái niệm kiểu dữ liệu trừu tượng, vai trò và tầm quan trọng của nó trong thiết kế phần mềm. Kiểu dữ liệu trừu tượng giúp chúng ta tập trung vào hành vi và chức năng của dữ liệu mà không cần quan tâm đến cách cài đặt chi tiết bên trong. Qua đó, nó giúp tăng tính linh hoạt và khả năng bảo trì của chương trình. Hãy cùng khám phá các đặc điểm chính của kiểu dữ liệu trừu tượng và cách áp dụng trong lập trình Java.', N'[{"SlideNumber":1,"Title":"Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, a glowing abstract shape symbolizing encapsulation and abstraction, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Kh\u00E1i ni\u1EC7m ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng (ADT)","T\u1EADp trung v\u00E0o h\u00E0nh vi, kh\u00F4ng ph\u1EA3i c\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t","Gi\u00FAp \u1EA9n chi ti\u1EBFt b\u00EAn trong"],"SpeakerNotes":"Slide n\u00E0y gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u kh\u00E1i ni\u1EC7m c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n v\u1EC1 ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng. ADT l\u00E0 m\u1ED9t m\u00F4 h\u00ECnh d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u00E1c thao t\u00E1c c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n m\u00E0 kh\u00F4ng ti\u1EBFt l\u1ED9 c\u00E1ch th\u1EE9c c\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t b\u00EAn trong. \u0110i\u1EC1u n\u00E0y gi\u00FAp l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh vi\u00EAn t\u1EADp trung v\u00E0o ch\u1EE9c n\u0103ng v\u00E0 giao di\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u."},{"SlideNumber":2,"Title":"Vai tr\u00F2 c\u1EE7a ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng trong OOP","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, interconnected abstract shapes representing modularity and encapsulation, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["T\u0103ng t\u00EDnh \u0111\u00F3ng g\u00F3i v\u00E0 b\u1EA3o m\u1EADt d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u","Gi\u00FAp thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF ph\u1EA7n m\u1EC1m linh ho\u1EA1t","D\u1EC5 d\u00E0ng b\u1EA3o tr\u00EC v\u00E0 m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng"],"SpeakerNotes":"Ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u0111\u00F3ng vai tr\u00F2 quan tr\u1ECDng trong l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng b\u1EB1ng c\u00E1ch t\u0103ng c\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u00F3ng g\u00F3i d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u v\u00E0 b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 th\u00F4ng tin n\u1ED9i b\u1ED9. N\u00F3 gi\u00FAp ph\u1EA7n m\u1EC1m tr\u1EDF n\u00EAn linh ho\u1EA1t h\u01A1n, d\u1EC5 d\u00E0ng thay \u0111\u1ED5i ho\u1EB7c m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng m\u00E0 kh\u00F4ng \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0111\u1EBFn c\u00E1c ph\u1EA7n kh\u00E1c."},{"SlideNumber":3,"Title":"\u0110\u1EB7c \u0111i\u1EC3m ch\u00EDnh c\u1EE7a ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract geometric shapes symbolizing abstraction and interface, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["\u0110\u1ECBnh ngh\u0129a t\u1EADp h\u1EE3p c\u00E1c thao t\u00E1c","\u1EA8n chi ti\u1EBFt c\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t b\u00EAn trong","T\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u00E1c qua giao di\u1EC7n r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng"],"SpeakerNotes":"Ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7c tr\u01B0ng b\u1EDFi vi\u1EC7c \u0111\u1ECBnh ngh\u0129a c\u00E1c thao t\u00E1c m\u00E0 d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3, \u0111\u1ED3ng th\u1EDDi \u1EA9n \u0111i c\u00E1ch th\u1EE9c c\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t chi ti\u1EBFt. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\u00F9ng t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u00E1c v\u1EDBi ADT th\u00F4ng qua m\u1ED9t giao di\u1EC7n r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng, gi\u00FAp gi\u1EA3m s\u1EF1 ph\u1EE5 thu\u1ED9c v\u00E0o chi ti\u1EBFt b\u00EAn trong."},{"SlideNumber":4,"Title":"V\u00ED d\u1EE5 minh h\u1ECDa ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract representation of a container holding elements, symbolizing a stack or queue, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Stack (ng\u0103n x\u1EBFp) l\u00E0 m\u1ED9t ADT","Ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u00E1c thao t\u00E1c push, pop, peek","Kh\u00F4ng quan t\u00E2m c\u00E1ch l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF b\u00EAn trong"],"SpeakerNotes":"V\u00ED d\u1EE5 \u0111i\u1EC3n h\u00ECnh c\u1EE7a ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng l\u00E0 ng\u0103n x\u1EBFp (stack). Ng\u0103n x\u1EBFp \u0111\u1ECBnh ngh\u0129a c\u00E1c thao t\u00E1c nh\u01B0 th\u00EAm ph\u1EA7n t\u1EED (push), l\u1EA5y ph\u1EA7n t\u1EED (pop), xem ph\u1EA7n t\u1EED tr\u00EAn c\u00F9ng (peek) m\u00E0 kh\u00F4ng c\u1EA7n bi\u1EBFt c\u00E1ch l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u b\u00EAn trong nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\u00E0o."},{"SlideNumber":5,"Title":"T\u00F3m t\u1EAFt v\u00E0 k\u1EBFt lu\u1EADn","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract glowing circle symbolizing completeness and understanding, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng t\u1EADp trung v\u00E0o h\u00E0nh vi","Gi\u00FAp t\u0103ng t\u00EDnh \u0111\u00F3ng g\u00F3i v\u00E0 b\u1EA3o tr\u00EC","L\u00E0 n\u1EC1n t\u1EA3ng quan tr\u1ECDng trong OOP"],"SpeakerNotes":"T\u00F3m l\u1EA1i, ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng l\u00E0 m\u1ED9t kh\u00E1i ni\u1EC7m c\u1ED1t l\u00F5i trong l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng, gi\u00FAp ch\u00FAng ta thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF ph\u1EA7n m\u1EC1m hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3 h\u01A1n b\u1EB1ng c\u00E1ch t\u1EADp trung v\u00E0o h\u00E0nh vi v\u00E0 \u1EA9n \u0111i chi ti\u1EBFt c\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t. Hi\u1EC3u r\u00F5 ADT s\u1EBD gi\u00FAp b\u1EA1n x\u00E2y d\u1EF1ng c\u00E1c \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng b\u1EC1n v\u1EEFng v\u00E0 d\u1EC5 d\u00E0ng m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng."}]', N'{"EstimatedDurationMinutes":10,"Tone":"truy\u1EC1n c\u1EA3m, th\u00E2n thi\u1EC7n, chuy\u00EAn nghi\u1EC7p","Pacing":"v\u1EEBa ph\u1EA3i, r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng, c\u00F3 nh\u1EA5n nh\u00E1","TargetAudience":"sinh vi\u00EAn \u0111\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc ng\u00E0nh c\u00F4ng ngh\u1EC7 th\u00F4ng tin, l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh vi\u00EAn m\u1EDBi b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u h\u1ECDc OOP","PronunciationNotes":"ph\u00E1t \u00E2m r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng c\u00E1c thu\u1EADt ng\u1EEF chuy\u00EAn ng\u00E0nh nh\u01B0 \u0027ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng\u0027, \u0027\u0111\u00F3ng g\u00F3i\u0027, \u0027giao di\u1EC7n\u0027, \u0027ng\u0103n x\u1EBFp\u0027, tr\u00E1nh n\u00F3i nhanh qu\u00E1 g\u00E2y kh\u00F3 hi\u1EC3u"}', N'Completed', '2026-06-12T13:17:09.492036', NULL, N'[{"SlideNumber":1,"Title":"Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng","NarrationText":"Slide n\u00E0y gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u kh\u00E1i ni\u1EC7m c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n v\u1EC1 ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u1EEBu t\u01B0\u1EE3ng. ADT l\u00E0 m\u1ED9t m\u00F4 h\u00ECnh d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u ch\u1EC9 \u01