INSERT INTO [dbo].[Lessons] ([Id], [ModuleId], [Title], [Description], [OrderIndex], [ContentSeed], [VideoUrl], [AudioUrl], [Duration], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [TeachingScript], [SlideOutlineJson], [VoiceoverPlanJson], [ContentGenerationStatus], [ContentGeneratedAt], [ContentGenerationError], [AudioSegmentsJson], [AudioGenerationStatus], [AudioGenerationError], [AudioGeneratedAt], [VideoGenerationStatus], [VideoGenerationError], [VideoGeneratedAt], [PresenterOverlayVideoPath], [PresenterOverlayStatus], [PresenterOverlayGeneratedAt], [PresenterOverlaySourceHash], [NarrationVoiceKey], [TranscriptText], [VoiceTutorEnabled]) VALUES ('220f0bac-c2b2-456c-9a43-fc006819c004', '98c4f99f-8800-4278-a885-cf6d4b0a2be8', N'Bẫy lỗi với try-catch-finally', N'Cách sử dụng try, catch và finally để xử lý lỗi.', 2, N'Bẫy lỗi với try-catch-finally', N'/storage/video/220f0bac-c2b2-456c-9a43-fc006819c004.mp4', N'/storage/audio/220f0bac-c2b2-456c-9a43-fc006819c004.mp3', 69, '2026-06-12T13:11:29.007852', '2026-06-12T13:49:11.838354', N'Chào mừng các bạn đến với bài học hôm nay về cách sử dụng try, catch và finally trong Java để xử lý lỗi. Trong lập trình, lỗi là điều không thể tránh khỏi, vì vậy chúng ta cần có cơ chế để bắt và xử lý các lỗi này một cách hiệu quả, tránh làm chương trình bị dừng đột ngột. Trong bài học này, tôi sẽ giới thiệu cho các bạn cấu trúc try-catch-finally, cách sử dụng từng phần và ví dụ minh họa cụ thể. Đầu tiên, chúng ta sẽ tìm hiểu về khối try, nơi đặt đoạn mã có thể phát sinh lỗi. Tiếp theo là khối catch, nơi xử lý lỗi khi có ngoại lệ xảy ra. Cuối cùng là khối finally, được thực thi bất kể có lỗi hay không, thường dùng để giải phóng tài nguyên. Hãy cùng bắt đầu!', N'[{"SlideNumber":1,"Title":"Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u v\u1EC1 x\u1EED l\u00FD ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract glowing shield protecting digital code streams, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["L\u1ED7i l\u00E0 \u0111i\u1EC1u kh\u00F4ng tr\u00E1nh kh\u1ECFi trong l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh","C\u1EA7n x\u1EED l\u00FD l\u1ED7i \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\u00ECnh \u1ED5n \u0111\u1ECBnh","Java cung c\u1EA5p c\u01A1 ch\u1EBF x\u1EED l\u00FD ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7"],"SpeakerNotes":"Slide n\u00E0y gi\u00FAp ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1ECDc hi\u1EC3u t\u1EA7m quan tr\u1ECDng c\u1EE7a vi\u1EC7c x\u1EED l\u00FD l\u1ED7i trong l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh, \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t trong Java. Vi\u1EC7c x\u1EED l\u00FD ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7 gi\u00FAp ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\u00ECnh kh\u00F4ng b\u1ECB d\u1EEBng \u0111\u1ED9t ng\u1ED9t v\u00E0 t\u0103ng t\u00EDnh \u1ED5n \u0111\u1ECBnh."},{"SlideNumber":2,"Title":"C\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc try-catch-finally","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract interconnected blocks representing flow control, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["try: ch\u1EE9a m\u00E3 c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 g\u00E2y l\u1ED7i","catch: b\u1EAFt v\u00E0 x\u1EED l\u00FD l\u1ED7i","finally: th\u1EF1c thi lu\u00F4n, d\u00F9ng \u0111\u1EC3 d\u1ECDn d\u1EB9p"],"SpeakerNotes":"Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u c\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n c\u1EE7a try-catch-finally. Kh\u1ED1i try ch\u1EE9a \u0111o\u1EA1n m\u00E3 c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 ph\u00E1t sinh ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7, catch d\u00F9ng \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EAFt v\u00E0 x\u1EED l\u00FD ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7 \u0111\u00F3, finally lu\u00F4n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EF1c thi \u0111\u1EC3 gi\u1EA3i ph\u00F3ng t\u00E0i nguy\u00EAn ho\u1EB7c th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n c\u00E1c thao t\u00E1c cu\u1ED1i c\u00F9ng."},{"SlideNumber":3,"Title":"Kh\u1ED1i try","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract glowing container holding fragile elements safely, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Ch\u1EE9a \u0111o\u1EA1n m\u00E3 c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 ph\u00E1t sinh l\u1ED7i","N\u1EBFu l\u1ED7i x\u1EA3y ra, chuy\u1EC3n sang catch","Kh\u00F4ng b\u1EAFt l\u1ED7i th\u00EC l\u1ED7i s\u1EBD truy\u1EC1n ra ngo\u00E0i"],"SpeakerNotes":"Kh\u1ED1i try l\u00E0 n\u01A1i \u0111\u1EB7t \u0111o\u1EA1n m\u00E3 m\u00E0 b\u1EA1n nghi ng\u1EDD c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 g\u00E2y ra l\u1ED7i. N\u1EBFu l\u1ED7i x\u1EA3y ra trong kh\u1ED1i n\u00E0y, ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\u00ECnh s\u1EBD t\u00ECm kh\u1ED1i catch ph\u00F9 h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1EC3 x\u1EED l\u00FD. N\u1EBFu kh\u00F4ng c\u00F3 catch ph\u00F9 h\u1EE3p, l\u1ED7i s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c truy\u1EC1n ra ngo\u00E0i v\u00E0 c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 l\u00E0m ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\u00ECnh d\u1EEBng."},{"SlideNumber":4,"Title":"Kh\u1ED1i catch","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract safety net catching falling objects, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["B\u1EAFt ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7 t\u1EEB try","X\u1EED l\u00FD ho\u1EB7c ghi nh\u1EADn l\u1ED7i","C\u00F3 th\u1EC3 c\u00F3 nhi\u1EC1u catch cho c\u00E1c lo\u1EA1i l\u1ED7i kh\u00E1c nhau"],"SpeakerNotes":"Kh\u1ED1i catch d\u00F9ng \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EAFt v\u00E0 x\u1EED l\u00FD ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7 ph\u00E1t sinh trong try. B\u1EA1n c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECBnh ngh\u0129a nhi\u1EC1u catch \u0111\u1EC3 x\u1EED l\u00FD c\u00E1c lo\u1EA1i ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7 kh\u00E1c nhau, gi\u00FAp ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\u00ECnh ph\u1EA3n h\u1ED3i ph\u00F9 h\u1EE3p v\u1EDBi t\u1EEBng t\u00ECnh hu\u1ED1ng l\u1ED7i."},{"SlideNumber":5,"Title":"Kh\u1ED1i finally","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract glowing circle symbolizing completion and cleanup, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["Lu\u00F4n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EF1c thi sau try-catch","D\u00F9ng \u0111\u1EC3 gi\u1EA3i ph\u00F3ng t\u00E0i nguy\u00EAn","\u0110\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o c\u00E1c thao t\u00E1c cu\u1ED1i c\u00F9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n"],"SpeakerNotes":"Kh\u1ED1i finally s\u1EBD lu\u00F4n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EF1c thi d\u00F9 c\u00F3 l\u1ED7i hay kh\u00F4ng, gi\u00FAp b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o c\u00E1c thao t\u00E1c nh\u01B0 \u0111\u00F3ng file, gi\u1EA3i ph\u00F3ng b\u1ED9 nh\u1EDB \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n, tr\u00E1nh r\u00F2 r\u1EC9 t\u00E0i nguy\u00EAn."},{"SlideNumber":6,"Title":"T\u00F3m t\u1EAFt v\u00E0 l\u01B0u \u00FD","ImageKeyword":"Flat vector illustration, minimalist corporate style, abstract checklist with glowing ticks, clean aesthetics, NO TEXT, NO NUMBERS, NO WORDS","BulletPoints":["S\u1EED d\u1EE5ng try-catch \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EAFt v\u00E0 x\u1EED l\u00FD l\u1ED7i","finally \u0111\u1EC3 d\u1ECDn d\u1EB9p t\u00E0i nguy\u00EAn","Vi\u1EBFt catch c\u1EE5 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EC3 x\u1EED l\u00FD ch\u00EDnh x\u00E1c l\u1ED7i"],"SpeakerNotes":"T\u00F3m t\u1EAFt l\u1EA1i c\u00E1ch s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng try-catch-finally v\u00E0 nh\u1EA5n m\u1EA1nh c\u00E1c l\u01B0u \u00FD quan tr\u1ECDng nh\u01B0 n\u00EAn vi\u1EBFt catch c\u1EE5 th\u1EC3, tr\u00E1nh b\u1EAFt l\u1ED7i chung chung \u0111\u1EC3 d\u1EC5 d\u00E0ng x\u1EED l\u00FD v\u00E0 b\u1EA3o tr\u00EC m\u00E3 ngu\u1ED3n."}]', N'{"EstimatedDurationMinutes":10,"Tone":"Th\u00E2n thi\u1EC7n, d\u1EC5 hi\u1EC3u, truy\u1EC1n c\u1EA3m","Pacing":"Ch\u1EADm r\u00E3i, r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng, c\u00F3 nh\u1EA5n m\u1EA1nh c\u00E1c \u0111i\u1EC3m quan tr\u1ECDng","TargetAudience":"Sinh vi\u00EAn \u0111\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc ng\u00E0nh c\u00F4ng ngh\u1EC7 th\u00F4ng tin, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EDBi h\u1ECDc l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh Java","PronunciationNotes":"Ph\u00E1t \u00E2m r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng c\u00E1c thu\u1EADt ng\u1EEF chuy\u00EAn ng\u00E0nh nh\u01B0 try, catch, finally, ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7, t\u00E0i nguy\u00EAn; tr\u00E1nh n\u00F3i nhanh \u0111\u1EC3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1ECDc d\u1EC5 theo d\u00F5i"}', N'Completed', '2026-06-12T13:48:12.866846', NULL, N'[{"SlideNumber":1,"Title":"Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u v\u1EC1 x\u1EED l\u00FD ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7","NarrationText":"Slide n\u00E0y gi\u00FAp ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1ECDc hi\u1EC3u t\u1EA7m quan tr\u1ECDng c\u1EE7a vi\u1EC7c x\u1EED l\u00FD l\u1ED7i trong l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh, \u0111\u1E